Bugfix: Keep waiting for S3 cold objects after rejected restore requests

Restic could stop waiting for a cold S3 object when S3 rejected a duplicate
restore request with `InvalidObjectState`. It then tried to read the archived
pack and retried indefinitely. Restic now keeps the pack in the warming-up
list until it becomes readable or the restore timeout expires.

https://github.com/restic/restic/issues/22094
